#: ../guide/getting_started.md:1 f19a347445ac43c0989e1512c2c05e61
msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: ../guide/getting_started.md:3 d984476ddae741258f3a225f9541bd6f
msgid ""
"This guide will help you get started with backtesting trading strategies "
"using QTrade."
msgstr "本指南帮你用 QTrade 上手回测交易策略。"

#: ../guide/getting_started.md:5 5cac509238514927acaf9f069498fab2
msgid "Strategy"
msgstr "策略"

#: ../guide/getting_started.md:7 1075eefae67b4da5b55bd3bd6cc8386b
msgid ""
"Let's create a simple SMA-crossover strategy. Custom strategies inherit "
"from `qtrade.Strategy` and implement `prepare()` (one-time setup) and "
"`on_bar_close()` (called on every bar):"
msgstr ""
"我们写一个简单的 SMA 交叉策略。自定义策略继承自 `qtrade.Strategy`，"
"实现 `prepare()`（一次性初始化）和 `on_bar_close()`（每根 bar 调用）："

#: ../guide/getting_started.md:34 426927b8abfa40c5b5355d19dce1c953
msgid "Data"
msgstr "数据"

#: ../guide/getting_started.md:36 dde91aac80a54fac92f4f238e5271eb9
msgid ""
"QTrade doesn't ship data loaders — bring your own OHLCV "
"`pandas.DataFrame` with `Open`, `High`, `Low`, `Close` (plus optional "
"`Volume`) columns and a `DatetimeIndex`. Column names are case-"
"insensitive (`open`, `Open`, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"QTrade 不内置数据源 —— 你需要自备 OHLCV 的 `pandas.DataFrame`，"
"包含 `Open`、`High`、`Low`、`Close` 列（`Volume` 可选），索引为 `DatetimeIndex`。"
"列名大小写不敏感（`open`、`Open` 都行）。"

#: ../guide/getting_started.md:40 d7526fcb86334ef4946e896e86201332
msgid "In this guide, we'll use `yfinance`:"
msgstr "本指南使用 `yfinance` 获取数据："

#: ../guide/getting_started.md:59 d2dd2098e8f542d89efc1c5c4e9b7047
msgid ""
"Indicators can be added in the strategy's `prepare()` (as shown above) or"
" on the DataFrame before passing it to `Backtest`. Indicators added to "
"the input DataFrame are visible to the strategy via `self.data`."
msgstr ""
"指标可以在策略的 `prepare()` 中添加（如上所示），也可以在传入 `Backtest` "
"之前直接加到 DataFrame 上。无论哪种方式，指标都能在策略里通过 `self.data` 访问。"

#: ../guide/getting_started.md:63 3c46680a8f0943ec870e9aeb44442118
msgid "Backtest"
msgstr "回测"

#: ../guide/getting_started.md:65 d0b3e10dbada4b638041bfd7400e1ac0
msgid "Now let's backtest our stratgy on prepared data."
msgstr "现在来用准备好的数据回测策略。"

#: ../guide/getting_started.md:111 3fa51dde88e04cd4bf1937affda688f2
msgid "Plot"
msgstr "可视化"

#: ../guide/getting_started.md:113 5977ee4ce3e348b5b9592846c9696097
msgid ""
"Qtrade uses Bokeh to plot result charts. You can generate a plot of your "
"backtest results with the following command:"
msgstr ""
"QTrade 使用 Bokeh 绘制结果图表。用以下命令生成回测结果可视化："

#: ../guide/getting_started.md:123 271e29c12a294daaafbbd9493b5676d7
msgid "Trades"
msgstr "交易明细"

#: ../guide/getting_started.md:125 6b6a0d54fe65486ebb34588331f71d2c
msgid "You can also check all trades by using the following commands:"
msgstr "也可以查看所有交易明细："

#: ../guide/getting_started.md:139 e02744f3607d4d30848d5b0741e078d2
msgid ""
"The `Asset` column is `\"default\"` for single-asset backtests and the "
"asset symbol when running on a portfolio (see [Multi-asset / portfolio "
"backtests](multi_asset.md))."
msgstr ""
"单资产回测下 `Asset` 列恒为 `\"default\"`；多资产组合回测时则为对应资产代码"
"（详见[多资产 / 投资组合回测](multi_asset.md)）。"

#: ../guide/getting_started.md:142 3211d1c4a29c4fa5b981d9fd841c8acd
msgid "Optimizing parameters (and avoiding overfitting)"
msgstr "参数优化（以及如何避免过拟合）"

#: ../guide/getting_started.md:144 94eac7513644498f975a4fad49805e74
msgid "`Backtest.optimize` runs a grid search across the parameter space:"
msgstr "`Backtest.optimize` 在参数空间做网格搜索："

#: ../guide/getting_started.md:155 deb6b942d73b465c8a2f027448f85494
msgid ""
"The catch: those \"best\" params are picked **on the same data they're "
"evaluated on**. They will look great in the backtest and frequently "
"disappoint live. Use `walk_forward_optimize` instead to get an out-of-"
"sample estimate:"
msgstr ""
"陷阱在于：这些「最优」参数是**在同一份数据上既调参又评估**得到的。"
"回测里看起来漂亮，实盘往往让人失望。使用 `walk_forward_optimize` "
"获得真正的样本外估计："

#: ../guide/getting_started.md:173 e2554e5a715a411cac3a760c0d18dfbb
msgid ""
"Each window picks its own best params on the train slice and is evaluated"
" on the immediately following test slice; `summary` reports aggregate "
"out-of-sample stats and `windows` has per-window details."
msgstr ""
"每个窗口在训练片段挑选自己的最优参数，并在紧接的测试片段评估；"
"`summary` 给出整体的样本外统计，`windows` 含每个窗口的细节。"
